From 351a506048bd649211e5c0f51743e4628cd7792b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWCH Phase 3 <phase3@openwch.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 01:55:55 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] RISC-V: assemble custom opcodes blocking v3c EVT

The v3c-led build stops in CH58x_sys.c because pristine GAS rejects mcpy.
Add the observed mcpy, wexti, mrslu, and mrsl encodings without an XW
gate, including the WCH funct5 parser and disassembler precedence for
overlapping vendor encodings.

Behavior specification:
  analysis/toolchain/wch-gcc-toolchain-survey.md sections 5.3 and 5.4
  ref/wch-isa-research/isa/custom/qingke-custom-isa.md sections 2.1 and 2.2
  ref/wch-isa-research/isa/custom/wch-custom-isa-reference.md sections 5.1 and 5.2
